{
  "about": [
    "The run-record golden vectors: fixed inputs, in the proto3 JSON form a client sends and",
    "receives, with the digest each must produce under docs/run-records.md. record/record_test.go,",
    "clients/python/tests/test_record.py and clients/typescript/test/record.test.ts all read this",
    "one file, so the three implementations cannot drift apart. The cell vectors were computed",
    "from docs/run-records.md alone by an independent Python implementation (2026-10-01), the",
    "others were cross-checked the same way on 2026-09-28. Changing a digest here changes the",
    "encoding for every verifier: change docs/run-records.md first.",
    "The \"unanswered record\" vector (version 3: a session call that may have run but ended in",
    "an error) was computed the same way, from docs/run-records.md alone, on 2026-10-01."
